context:
GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/alerting/v3/destinations/pagerduty/connect/{token_id}
Links PagerDuty with the account using the integration token.
Required: account_id (path); token_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/alerting/v3/policies/{policy_id}
Delete a Notification policy.
Required: account_id (path); policy_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/alerting/v3/policies/{policy_id}
Get details for a single policy.
Required: account_id (path); policy_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/alerting/v3/policies/{policy_id}
Update a Notification policy.
Required: account_id (path); policy_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/alerting/v3/silences/{silence_id}
Deletes an existing silence for an account.
Required: account_id (path); silence_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/alerting/v3/silences/{silence_id}
Gets a specific silence for an account.
Required: account_id (path); silence_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/alerting/v3/destinations/webhooks/{webhook_id}
Delete a configured webhook destination.
Required: webhook_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/alerting/v3/destinations/webhooks/{webhook_id}
Get details for a single webhooks destination.
Required: account_id (path); webhook_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/alerting/v3/destinations/webhooks/{webhook_id}
Update a webhook destination.
Required: webhook_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)
